('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon:20:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon','en','To Your Holy Temple return and to the Holy of Holies,','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Yah Ribon'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon:20:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon','transliteration','le-meek-dah-shehkh toov oo-le-koh-dehsh kood-sheen.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Yah Ribon'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon:21:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon','he','אֲתַר דִּי בֵיהּ יֶחֱדוּן רוּחִין וְנַפְשִׁין.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Yah Ribon'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon:21:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon','en','the place where they will rejoice—spirits and souls;','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Yah Ribon'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon:21:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon','transliteration','ah-tahr dee veyh yeh-kheh-doon roo-kheen ve-nahf-sheen.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Yah Ribon'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon:22:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon','he','וִיזַמְּ֒רוּן לָךְ שִׁירִין וְרַחֲשִׁין.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Yah Ribon'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon:22:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon','en','and they will sing to You songs and praises','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Yah Ribon'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon:22:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon','transliteration','vee-zah-ME-roon lahkh shee-reen ve-rah-khah-sheen.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Yah Ribon'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon:23:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon','he','בִּירוּשְׁ֒לֵם קַרְתָּא דְשׁוּפְרַיָּא.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Yah Ribon'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon:23:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon','en','in Jerusalem, city of beauty.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Yah Ribon'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon:23:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon','transliteration','bee-roo-SHE-lehm kahr-tah de-shoo-fe-rah-yah.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Yah Ribon'),
