('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon:24:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-yah-ribon','transliteration','yahh ree-bohn ah-lahm ve-ah-le-mah-yah. ahnt hoo mahl-kah meh-lehkh mahl-khah-yah:','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Yah Ribon'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:0:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','צוּר מִשֶּׁלּוֹ אָכַֽלְנוּ בָּרְכוּ אֱמוּנַי','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:0:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','The Rock—from His [store] we have eaten—Bless Him my faithful ones.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
