('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:1:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','שָׂבַֽעְנוּ וְהוֹתַֽרְנוּ כִּדְבַר יְהֹוָה׃','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:1:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','We have satisfied ourselves and we have left over [some food], according to the word of Adonoy.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:1:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','sah-vah-e-noo ve-hoh-tah-re-noo keed-vahr ah-doh-NAI','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:2:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','הַזָּן אֶת עוֹלָמוֹ רוֹעֵֽנוּ אָבִֽינוּ','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:2:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','He nourishes His world, our Shepherd our Father.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:2:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','hah-zahn eht oh-lah-moh roh-eh-noo ah-vee-noo','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:3:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','אָכַֽלְנוּ אֶת לַחְמוֹ וְיֵינוֹ שָׁתִֽינוּ','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:3:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','We have eaten His bread and His wine we drank.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:3:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','ah-khah-le-noo eht lahkh-moh ve-yey-noh shah-tee-noo','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:4:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','עַל כֵּן נוֹדֶה לִשְׁמוֹ וּנְהַלְּלוֹ בְּפִֽינוּ','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:4:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','Therefore, we give thanks to His Name, and praise Him with our mouths—','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:4:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','ahl kehn noh-deh leesh-moh oo-ne-hah-le-loh be-fee-noo','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:5:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','אָמַֽרְנוּ וְעָנִֽינוּ אֵין קָדוֹשׁ כַּיהֹוָה׃','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
