('sefaria-siddur-sefard-weekday-shacharit-song-of-the-day:17:he','sefaria-siddur-sefard-weekday-shacharit-song-of-the-day','he','בחמישי בשבת:','Siddur Sefard, Weekday Shacharit, Song of the Day'),
