('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:0:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','שִׁ֥יר הַשִּׁירִ֖ים אֲשֶׁ֥ר לִשְׁלֹמֹֽה:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:0:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','The song of songs which is Shlomo''s.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:0:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','SHEER hah-shee-REEM ah-SHEHR leesh-loh-mohh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:1:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','יִשָּׁקֵ֨נִי֙ מִנְּשִׁיק֣וֹת פִּ֔יהוּ כִּֽי־טוֹבִ֥ים דֹּדֶ֖יךָ מִיָּֽיִן:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:1:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','Let him kiss me with the kisses of his mouth, for your love is dearer than wine.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:1:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','yee-shah-KEH-nee mee-ne-shee-KOHT PEE-hoo kee toh-VEEM doh-DEY-khah mee-yah-yeen:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:2:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','לְרֵ֨יחַ֙ שְׁמָנֶ֣יךָ טוֹבִ֔ים שֶׁ֖מֶן תּוּרַ֣ק שְׁמֶ֑ךָ עַל־כֵּ֖ן עֲלָמ֥וֹת אֲהֵבֽוּךָ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:2:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','Like the fragrance of good oils, your name is like flowing oil; therefore young maidens love you.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:2:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','le-REY-ahkh she-mah-NEY-khah toh-VEEM SHEH-mehn too-RAHK she-MEH-khah ahl KEHN ah-lah-MOHT ah-heh-voo-khah:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:3:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','מָשְׁכֵ֖נִי אַֽחֲרֶ֣יךָ נָר֑וּצָה הֱבִיאַ֨נִי הַמֶּ֜לֶךְ חֲדָרָ֗יו נָגִ֤ילָה וְנִשְׂמְחָה֙ בָּ֔ךְ נַזְכִּ֤ירָה דֹדֶ֙יךָ֙ מִיַּ֔יִן מֵֽישָׁרִ֖ים אֲהֵבֽוּךָ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:3:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','Draw me, we will run after you; the king has brought me into his chambers, we will be glad and rejoice in you, we recall your love more than wine, they love you sincerely.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:3:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','mah-she-KHEH-nee ah-khah-REY-khah nah-ROO-tsah heh-vee-AH-nee hah-MEH-lehkh khah-dah-RAHV nah-GEE-lah ve-nees-me-KHAH BAHKH nahz-KEE-rah doh-DEY-khah mee-YAH-yeen mey-shah-REEM ah-heh-voo-khah:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:4:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','שְׁחוֹרָ֤ה אֲנִי֙ וְֽנָאוָ֔ה בְּנ֖וֹת יְרֽוּשָׁלִָ֑ם כְּאָֽהֳלֵ֣י קֵדָ֔ר כִּֽירִיע֖וֹת שְׁלֹמֹֽה:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:4:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','I am black, but comely, daughters of Jerusalem; like the tents of Kedar, like the curtains of Shlomo.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:4:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','she-khoh-RAH ah-NEE ve-nah-VAH be-NOHT ye-roo-shah-LAH-eem ke-oh-hoh-LEY keh-DAHR kee-ree-OHT she-loh-mohh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:5:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','אַל־תִּרְאֻ֨נִי֙ שֶֽׁאֲנִ֣י שְׁחַרְחֹ֔רֶת שֶׁשְּׁזָפַ֖תְנִי הַשָּׁ֑מֶשׁ בְּנֵ֧י אִמִּ֣י נִֽחֲרוּ־בִ֗י שָׂמֻ֨נִי֙ נֹֽטֵרָ֣ה אֶת־הַכְּרָמִ֔ים כַּרְמִ֥י שֶׁלִּ֖י לֹ֥א נָטָֽרְתִּי:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:5:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','Do not look upon me [with contempt] that I am so black, for the sun has tanned me; my mother''s sons were incensed against me, they made me keeper of the vineyards, [but] my own vineyard I did not watch.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:5:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','ahl teer-OO-nee sheh-ah-NEE she-khahr-KHOH-reht sheh-she-zah-FAHT-nee hah-SHAH-mehsh be-NEY ee-MEE nee-khah-roo VEE sah-MOO-nee noh-teh-RAH eht hah-ke-rah-MEEM kahr-MEE sheh-LEE LOH nah-tah-re-tee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:6:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','הַגִּ֣ידָה לִּ֗י שֶׁ֤אָֽהֲבָה֙ נַפְשִׁ֔י אֵיכָ֣ה תִרְעֶ֔ה אֵיכָ֖ה תַּרְבִּ֣יץ בַּֽצָּֽהֳרָ֑יִם שַׁלָּמָ֤ה אֶֽהְיֶה֙ כְּעֹ֣טְיָ֔ה עַ֖ל עֶדְרֵ֥י חֲבֵרֶֽיךָ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:6:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','Tell me, you whom my soul loves, where do you graze your flock where do you rest your flock at noon; for why should I flit about around the flocks of your companions?','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:6:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','hah-GEE-dah LEE SHEH-ah-hah-VAH nahf-SHEE ey-KHAH teer-EH ey-KHAH tahr-BEETS bah-tsoh-hoh-RAH-yeem shah-lah-MAH eh-he-YEH ke-OH-te-YAH AHL ehd-REY khah-veh-rey-khah:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:7:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','אִם־לֹ֤א תֵֽדְעִי֙ לָ֔ךְ הַיָּפָ֖ה בַּנָּשִׁ֑ים צְֽאִי־לָ֞ךְ בְּעִקְבֵ֣י הַצֹּ֗אן וּרְעִי֙ אֶת־גְּדִיֹּתַ֔יִךְ עַ֖ל מִשְׁכְּנ֥וֹת הָֽרֹעִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:7:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','If you do not know [you who are the] fairest of women; go forth in the footsteps of the sheep and pasture your kids near the dwellings of the shepherds.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:7:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','eem LOH teh-de-EE LAHKH hah-yah-FAH bah-nah-SHEEM tse-ee LAHKH be-eek-VEY hah-TSOHN oo-re-EE eht ge-dee-yoh-TAH-yeekh AHL meesh-ke-NOHT hah-roh-eem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:8:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','לְסֻֽסָתִי֙ בְּרִכְבֵ֣י פַרְעֹ֔ה דִּמִּיתִ֖יךְ רַעְיָתִֽי:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:8:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','To steeds in the chariots of Pharaoh I have likened you, my beloved.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:8:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','le-soo-sah-TEE be-reekh-VEY fahr-OHH dee-mee-TEEKH rah-yah-tee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:9:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','נָאו֤וּ לְחָיַ֨יִךְ֙ בַּתֹּרִ֔ים צַוָּארֵ֖ךְ בַּֽחֲרוּזִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:9:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','Your cheeks are comely with rows of gems your neck with [pearl] necklaces.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:9:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','nah-VOO le-khah-YAH-yeekh bah-toh-REEM tsah-vah-REHKH bah-khah-roo-zeem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:10:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','תּוֹרֵ֤י זָהָב֙ נַֽעֲשֶׂה־לָּ֔ךְ עִ֖ם נְקֻדּ֥וֹת הַכָּֽסֶף:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:10:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','Circlets of gold we will make for you with spangles of silver.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:10:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','toh-REY zah-HAHV nah-ah-seh LAHKH EEM ne-koo-DOHT hah-kah-sehf:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:11:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','עַד־שֶׁ֤הַמֶּ֨לֶךְ֙ בִּמְסִבּ֔וֹ נִרְדִּ֖י נָתַ֥ן רֵיחֽוֹ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:11:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','While the king was at his table, my spikenard gave out its fragrance.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:11:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','ahd SHEH-hah-MEH-lehkh beem-see-BOH neer-DEE nah-TAHN rey-khoh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:12:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','צְר֨וֹר הַמֹּ֤ר | דּוֹדִי֙ לִ֔י בֵּ֥ין שָׁדַ֖י יָלִֽין:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:12:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','A bundle of myrrh is my beloved to me, between my breasts he shall lie.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:12:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','tse-ROHR hah-MOHR | doh-DEE LEE BEYN shah-DAHY yah-leen:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:13:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','אֶשְׁכֹּ֨ל הַכֹּ֤פֶר | דּוֹדִי֙ לִ֔י בְּכַרְמֵ֖י עֵ֥ין גֶּֽדִי:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:13:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','A cluster of henna is my beloved to me in the vineyards of En-gedi.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:13:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','ehsh-KOHL hah-KOH-fehr | doh-DEE LEE be-khahr-MEY EYN geh-dee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:14:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','הִנָּ֤ךְ יָפָה֙ רַעְיָתִ֔י הִנָּ֥ךְ יָפָ֖ה עֵינַ֥יִךְ יוֹנִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:14:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','Behold you are beautiful, my beloved, behold you are beautiful; your eyes are like doves.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:14:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','hee-NAHKH yah-FAH rah-yah-TEE hee-NAHKH yah-FAH ey-NAH-yeekh yoh-neem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:15:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','הִנְּךָ֨ יָפֶ֤ה דוֹדִי֙ אַ֣ף נָעִ֔ים אַף־עַרְשֵׂ֖נוּ רַֽעֲנָנָֽה:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:15:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','You are handsome, my beloved, most handsome; indeed our bed is fresh.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:15:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','hee-ne-KHAH yah-FEH doh-DEE AHF nah-EEM ahf ahr-SEH-noo rah-ah-nah-nah:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:16:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','he','קֹר֤וֹת בָּתֵּ֨ינוּ֙ אֲרָזִ֔ים רָֽהִ֯יטֵ֖נוּ בְּרוֹתִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:16:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','en','The beams of our houses are cedars, our panels are cypresses.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1:16:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-1','transliteration','koh-ROHT bah-TEY-noo ah-rah-ZEEM rah-hee-TEH-noo be-roh-teem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.1'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:0:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','אֲנִי֙ חֲבַצֶּ֣לֶת הַשָּׁר֔וֹן שֽׁוֹשַׁנַּ֖ת הָֽעֲמָקִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:0:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','I am a rose of Sharon a rose of the valleys.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:0:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','ah-NEE khah-vah-TSEH-leht hah-shah-ROHN shoh-shah-NAHT hah-ah-mah-keem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:1:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','כְּשֽׁוֹשַׁנָּה֙ בֵּ֣ין הַֽחוֹחִ֔ים כֵּ֥ן רַעְיָתִ֖י בֵּ֥ין הַבָּנֽוֹת:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:1:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','As a rose among the thorns, so is my beloved among the daughters.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:1:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','ke-shoh-shah-NAH BEYN hah-khoh-KHEEM KEHN rah-yah-TEE BEYN hah-bah-noht:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:2:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','כְּתַפּ֨וּחַ֙ בַּֽעֲצֵ֣י הַיַּ֔עַר כֵּ֥ן דּוֹדִ֖י בֵּ֣ין הַבָּנִ֑ים בְּצִלֹּו֙ חִמַּ֣דְתִּי וְיָשַׁ֔בְתִּי וּפִרְי֖וֹ מָת֥וֹק לְחִכִּֽי:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:2:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','As an apple tree among the trees of the forest, so is my beloved among the sons; in its shade I delighted and sat, and its fruit was sweet to my palate.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:2:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','ke-tah-POO-ahkh bah-ah-TSEY hah-YAH-ahr KEHN doh-DEE BEYN hah-bah-NEEM be-tsee-LOH khee-MAHD-tee ve-yah-SHAHV-tee oo-feer-YOH mah-TOHK le-khee-kee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:3:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','הֱבִיאַ֨נִי֙ אֶל־בֵּ֣ית הַיָּ֔יִן וְדִגְל֥וֹ עָלַ֖י אַֽהֲבָֽה:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:3:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','He brought me to the banqueting-house, and his banner is raised over me in love.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:3:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','heh-vee-AH-nee ehl BEYT hah-YAH-yeen ve-deeg-LOH ah-LAHY ah-hah-vah:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:4:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','סַמְּכ֨וּנִי֙ בָּֽאֲשִׁישׁ֔וֹת רַפְּד֖וּנִי בַּתַּפּוּחִ֑ים כִּֽי־חוֹלַ֥ת אַֽהֲבָ֖ה אָֽנִי:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:4:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','Sustain me with dainty cakes refresh my bed with [the scent of] apples; for I am lovesick.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:4:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','sah-me-KHOO-nee bah-ah-shee-SHOHT rah-pe-DOO-nee bah-tah-poo-KHEEM kee khoh-LAHT ah-hah-VAH ah-nee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:5:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','שְׂמֹאלֹו֙ תַּ֣חַת לְרֹאשִׁ֔י וִֽימִינ֖וֹ תְּחַבְּקֵֽנִי:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:5:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','His left hand was under my head and his right would embrace me.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:5:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','se-moh-LOH TAH-khaht le-roh-SHEE vee-mee-NOH te-khah-be-keh-nee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:6:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','הִשְׁבַּ֨עְתִּי אֶתְכֶ֜ם בְּנ֤וֹת יְרֽוּשָׁלַ֨םִ֙ בִּצְבָא֔וֹת א֖וֹ בְּאַיְל֣וֹת הַשָדֶ֑ה אִם־תָּעִ֧ירוּ | וְֽאִם־תְּעֽוֹרְר֛וּ אֶת־הָאַֽהֲבָ֖ה עַ֥ד שֶׁתֶּחְפָּֽץ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:6:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','I bind you under oath, daughters of Jerusalem by the gazelles and the does of the field; that you do not cause hatred nor disturb this love while it still pleases.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:6:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','heesh-BAH-tee eht-KHEHM be-NOHT ye-roo-shah-LAH-mee beets-vah-OHT OH be-ahy-LOHT hah-shah-DEH eem tah-EE-roo | ve-eem te-oh-re-ROO eht hah-ah-hah-VAH AHD sheh-tehkh-pahts:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:7:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','ק֣וֹל דּוֹדִ֔י הִנֵּה־זֶ֖ה בָּ֑א מְדַלֵּג֙ עַל־הֶ֣הָרִ֔ים מְקַפֵּ֖ץ עַל־הַגְּבָעֽוֹת:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:7:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','The voice of my beloved! Behold he comes; leaping over the mountains, skipping over the hills.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:7:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','KOHL doh-DEE hee-neh ZEH BAH me-dah-LEHG ahl HEH-hah-REEM me-kah-PEHTS ahl hah-ge-vah-oht:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:8:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','דּוֹמֶ֤ה דוֹדִי֙ לִצְבִ֔י א֖וֹ לְעֹ֣פֶר הָֽאַיָּלִ֑ים הִנֵּה־זֶ֤ה עוֹמֵד֙ אַחַ֣ר כָּתְלֵ֔נוּ מַשְׁגִּ֨יחַ֙ מִן־הַֽחַלֹּנ֔וֹת מֵצִ֖יץ מִן־הַֽחֲרַכִּֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:8:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','My beloved resembles a gazelle or a young hart; behold, he stands behind our wall, observing through the windows peering through the lattices.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:8:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','doh-MEH doh-DEE leets-VEE OH le-OH-fehr hah-ah-yah-LEEM hee-neh ZEH oh-MEHD ah-KHAHR kah-te-LEH-noo mahsh-GEE-ahkh meen hah-khah-loh-NOHT meh-TSEETS meen hah-khah-rah-keem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:9:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','עָנָ֥ה דוֹדִ֖י וְאָ֣מַר לִ֑י ק֥וּמִי לָ֛ךְ רַעְיָתִ֥י יָֽפָתִ֖י וּלְכִי־לָֽךְ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:9:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','My beloved spoke and said to me, “Rise up, my beloved, my fair one, and go forth.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:9:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','ah-NAH doh-DEE ve-AH-mahr LEE KOO-mee LAHKH rah-yah-TEE yah-fah-TEE oo-le-khee lahkh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:10:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','כִּֽי־הִנֵּ֥ה הַסְּתָ֖יּו עָבָ֑ר הַגֶּ֕שֶׁם חָלַ֖ף הָלַ֥ךְ לֽוֹ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:10:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','For behold, the winter is past, the rain is over, and gone.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:10:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','kee hee-NEH hah-se-TAHYV ah-VAHR hah-GEH-shehm khah-LAHF hah-LAHKH loh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:11:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','הַנִּצָּנִים֙ נִרְא֣וּ בָאָ֔רֶץ עֵ֥ת הַזָּמִ֖יר הִגִּ֑יעַ וְק֥וֹל הַתּ֖וֹר נִשְׁמַ֥ע בְּאַרְצֵֽנוּ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:11:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','The blossoms have appeared on the land, the time of singing has come; and the voice of the turtledove is heard in our land.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:11:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','hah-nee-tsah-NEEM neer-OO vah-AH-rehts EHT hah-zah-MEER hee-GEE-ah ve-KOHL hah-TOHR neesh-MAH be-ahr-tseh-noo:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:12:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','הַתְּאֵנָה֙ חָֽנְטָ֣ה פַגֶּ֔יהָ וְהַגְּפָנִ֥ים | סְמָדַ֖ר נָ֣תְנוּ רֵ֑יחַ ק֥וּמִי לָ֛ךְ֯ רַעְיָתִ֥י יָֽפָתִ֖י וּלְכִי־לָֽךְ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:12:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','The fig tree has produced its green figs, and the grapevines tender grapes give out their fragrance; arise my beloved, my fair one, and go forth.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:12:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','hah-te-eh-NAH khah-ne-TAH fah-GEY-hah ve-hah-ge-fah-NEEM | se-mah-DAHR NAH-te-noo REY-ahkh KOO-mee LAHKH rah-yah-TEE yah-fah-TEE oo-le-khee lahkh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:13:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','יֽוֹנָתִ֞י בְּחַגְוֵ֣י הַסֶּ֗לַע בְּסֵ֨תֶר֙ הַמַּדְרֵגָ֔ה הַרְאִ֨ינִי֙ אֶת־מַרְאַ֔יִךְ הַשְׁמִיעִ֖נִי אֶת־קוֹלֵ֑ךְ כִּֽי־קוֹלֵ֥ךְ עָרֵ֖ב וּמַרְאֵ֥יךְ נָאוֶֽה:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:13:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','My dove, in the clefts of the rock, in the concealment of the cliff, show me your countenance, let me hear your voice; for your voice is sweet and your countenance is comely.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:13:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','yoh-nah-TEE be-khahg-VEY hah-SEH-lah be-SEH-tehr hah-mahd-reh-GAH hahr-EE-nee eht mahr-AH-yeekh hahsh-mee-EE-nee eht koh-LEHKH kee koh-LEHKH ah-REHV oo-mahr-EYKH nah-veh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:14:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','אֶֽחֱזוּ־לָ֨נוּ֙ שֽׁוּעָלִ֔ים שֻֽׁעָלִ֥ים קְטַנִּ֖ים מְחַבְּלִ֣ים כְּרָמִ֑ים וּכְרָמֵ֖ינוּ סְמָדַֽר:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:14:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','Seize for us the foxes, little foxes that destroy vineyards [for] our vineyards are with tender grapes.”','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:14:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','eh-kheh-zoo LAH-noo shoo-ah-LEEM shoo-ah-LEEM ke-tah-NEEM me-khah-be-LEEM ke-rah-MEEM oo-khe-rah-MEY-noo se-mah-dahr:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:15:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','דּוֹדִ֥י לִי֙ וַֽאֲנִ֣י ל֔וֹ הָֽרֹעֶ֖ה בַּשּֽׁוֹשַׁנִּֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:15:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','My beloved is mine, and I am his, who pastures among the roses.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:15:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','doh-DEE LEE vah-ah-NEE LOH hah-roh-EH bah-shoh-shah-neem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:16:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','he','עַ֤ד שֶׁיָּפ֨וּחַ֙ הַיּ֔וֹם וְנָ֖סוּ הַצְּלָלִ֑ים סֹב֩ דְּמֵֽה־לְךָ֨ דוֹדִ֜י לִצְבִ֗י א֛וֹ לְעֹ֥פֶר הָֽאַיָּלִ֖ים עַל־הָ֥רֵי בָֽתֶר:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:16:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','en','Until the sun spreads and the shadows flee; you turned away, my beloved, and became like a gazelle or a young hart on distant mountains.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2:16:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-2','transliteration','AHD sheh-yah-FOO-ahkh hah-YOHM ve-NAH-soo hah-tse-lah-LEEM SOHV de-meh le-KHAH doh-DEE leets-VEE OH le-OH-fehr hah-ah-yah-LEEM ahl HAH-rey vah-tehr:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.2'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:0:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','he','עַל־מִשְׁכָּבִי֙ בַּלֵּיל֔וֹת בִּקַּ֕שְׁתִּי אֵ֥ת שֶׁאָֽהֲבָ֖ה נַפְשִׁ֑י בִּקַּשְׁתִּ֖יו וְלֹ֥א מְצָאתִֽיו:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:0:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','en','On my bed at night, I sought him whom my soul loves; I sought him but did not find him.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:0:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','transliteration','ahl meesh-kah-VEE bah-ley-LOHT bee-KAHSH-tee EHT sheh-ah-hah-VAH nahf-SHEE bee-kahsh-TEEV ve-LOH me-tsah-teev:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:1:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','he','אָק֨וּמָה נָּ֜א וַֽאֲסֽוֹבְבָ֣ה בָעִ֗יר בַּשְּׁוָקִים֙ וּבָ֣רְחֹב֔וֹת אֲבַקְשָׁ֕ה אֵ֥ת שֶׁאָֽהֲבָ֖ה נַפְשִׁ֑י בִּקַּשְׁתִּ֖יו וְלֹ֥א מְצָאתִֽיו:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:1:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','en','I will rise now and roam through the city, in the market places and in the streets, I will seek him whom my soul loves; I sought him but did not find him.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:1:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','transliteration','ah-KOO-mah NAH vah-ah-soh-ve-VAH vah-EER bah-she-vah-KEEM oo-VAH-re-khoh-VOHT ah-vahk-SHAH EHT sheh-ah-hah-VAH nahf-SHEE bee-kahsh-TEEV ve-LOH me-tsah-teev:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:2:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','he','מְצָא֨וּנִי֙ הַשֹּׁ֣מְרִ֔ים הַסֹּֽבְבִ֖ים בָּעִ֑יר אֵ֛ת שֶׁאָֽהֲבָ֥ה נַפְשִׁ֖י רְאִיתֶֽם:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:2:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','en','The watchmen found me those who circle about the city; him whom my soul loves, have you seen him?','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:2:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','transliteration','me-tsah-OO-nee hah-SHOH-me-REEM hah-soh-ve-VEEM bah-EER EHT sheh-ah-hah-VAH nahf-SHEE re-ee-tehm:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:3:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','he','כִּמְעַט֙ שֶֽׁעָבַ֣רְתִּי מֵהֶ֔ם עַ֣ד שֶׁמָּצָ֔אתִי אֵ֥ת שֶׁאָֽהֲבָ֖ה נַפְשִׁ֑י אֲחַזְתִּיו֙ וְלֹ֣א אַרְפֶּ֔נּוּ עַד־שֶׁ֤הֲבֵיאתִיו֙ אֶל־בֵּ֣ית אִמִּ֔י וְאֶל־חֶ֖דֶר הֽוֹרָתִֽי:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:3:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','en','Scarcely had I departed from them, when I found him whom my soul loves; I grasped him and would not let him go until I brought him to my mother''s house and to the chamber of her who conceived me.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:3:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','transliteration','keem-AHT sheh-ah-VAHR-tee meh-HEHM AHD sheh-mah-TSAH-tee EHT sheh-ah-hah-VAH nahf-SHEE ah-khahz-TEEV ve-LOH ahr-PEH-noo ahd SHEH-hah-veh--TEEV ehl BEYT ee-MEE ve-ehl KHEH-dehr hoh-rah-tee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:4:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','he','הִשְׁבַּ֨עְתִּי אֶתְכֶ֜ם בְּנ֤וֹת יְרֽוּשָׁלַ֨םִ֙ בִּצְבָא֔וֹת א֖וֹ בְּאַיְל֣וֹת הַשָדֶ֑ה אִם־תָּעִ֧ירוּ | וְֽאִם־תְּעֽוֹרְר֛וּ אֶת־הָאַֽהֲבָ֖ה עַ֥ד שֶׁתֶּחְפָּֽץ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:4:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','en','I bind you under oath, daughters of Jerusalem by the gazelles and the does of the field; that you do not cause hatred nor disturb this love while it still pleases.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:4:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','transliteration','heesh-BAH-tee eht-KHEHM be-NOHT ye-roo-shah-LAH-mee beets-vah-OHT OH be-ahy-LOHT hah-shah-DEH eem tah-EE-roo | ve-eem te-oh-re-ROO eht hah-ah-hah-VAH AHD sheh-tehkh-pahts:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:5:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','he','מִ֣י זֹ֗את עֹלָה֙ מִן־הַמִּדְבָּ֔ר כְּתִֽימְר֖וֹת עָשָׁ֑ן מְקֻטֶּ֤רֶת מֹר֙ וּלְבוֹנָ֔ה מִכֹּ֖ל אַבְקַ֥ת רוֹכֵֽל:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:5:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','en','Who is this ascending from the desert, with palm-like pillars of smoke; in a cloud of myrrh and frankincense, of all the powders of the perfume seller?','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:5:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','transliteration','MEE ZOHT oh-LAH meen hah-meed-BAHR ke-tee-me-ROHT ah-SHAHN me-koo-TEH-reht MOHR oo-le-voh-NAH mee-KOHL ahv-KAHT roh-khehl:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:6:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','he','הִנֵּ֗ה מִטָּתוֹ שֶׁלִּשְׁלֹמֹ֔ה שִׁשִּׁ֥ים גִּבֹּרִ֖ים סָבִ֣יב לָ֑הּ מִגִּבֹּרֵ֖י יִשְׂרָאֵֽל:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:6:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','en','Behold the bed of Shlomo, sixty mighty men are around it; of the mighty men of Israel.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:6:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','transliteration','hee-NEH mee-tah-toh sheh-leesh-loh-MOHH shee-SHEEM gee-boh-REEM sah-VEEV LAHH mee-gee-boh-REY yees-rah-ehl:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:7:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','he','כֻּלָּם֙ אֲחֻ֣זֵי חֶ֔רֶב מְלֻמְּדֵ֖י מִלְחָמָ֑ה אִ֤ישׁ חַרְבּוֹ עַל־יְרֵכ֔וֹ מִפַּ֖חַד בַּלֵּילֽוֹת:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:7:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','en','All of them holding swords, skilled in battle; each with his sword at his side for fear of the nights.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:7:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','transliteration','koo-LAHM ah-KHOO-zey KHEH-rehv me-loo-me-DEY meel-khah-MAH EESH khahr-boh ahl ye-reh-KHOH mee-PAH-khahd bah-ley-loht:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:8:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','he','אַפִּרְי֗וֹן עָ֤שָׂה לוֹ הַמֶּ֣לֶךְ שְׁלֹמֹ֔ה מֵֽעֲצֵ֖י הַלְּבָנֽוֹן:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:8:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','en','A canopy has King Shlomo made of the wood of Lebanon.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:8:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','transliteration','ah-peer-YOHN AH-sah loh hah-MEH-lehkh she-loh-MOHH meh-ah-TSEY hah-le-vah-nohn:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:9:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','he','עַמּוּדָיו֙ עָ֣שָׂה כֶ֔סֶף רְפִֽידָת֣וֹ זָהָ֔ב מֶרְכָּב֖וֹ אַרְגָּמָ֑ן תּוֹכוֹ רָצ֣וּף אַֽהֲבָ֔ה מִבְּנ֖וֹת יְרֽוּשָׁלָֽםִ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:9:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','en','Its pillars he made of silver, its covering of gold, its curtain of purple wool; its interior bedecked with love from the daughters of Jerusalem.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:9:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','transliteration','ah-moo-DAHV AH-sah KHEH-sehf re-fee-dah-TOH zah-HAHV mehr-kah-VOH ahr-gah-MAHN toh-khoh rah-TSOOF ah-hah-VAH mee-be-NOHT ye-roo-shah-lah-mee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:10:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','he','צְאֶ֧ינָה | וּֽרְאֶ֛ינָה בְּנ֥וֹת צִיּ֖וֹן בַּמֶּ֣לֶךְ שְׁלֹמֹ֑ה בָּֽעֲטָרָ֗ה שֶֽׁעִטְּרָה־לּ֤וֹ אִמּוֹ בְּי֣וֹם חֲתֻנָּת֔וֹ וּבְי֖וֹם שִׂמְחַ֥ת לִבּֽוֹ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:10:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','en','Go forth and gaze, daughters of Zion, upon King Shlomo; upon the crown with which his mother adorned him on the day of his wedding, and on the day his heart rejoiced.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3:10:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-3','transliteration','tse-EY-nah | oo-re-EY-nah be-NOHT tsee-YOHN bah-MEH-lehkh she-loh-MOHH bah-ah-tah-RAH sheh-ee-te-rah LOH ee-moh be-YOHM khah-too-nah-TOH oo-ve-YOHM seem-KHAHT lee-boh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.3'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:0:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','הִנָּ֨ךְ יָפָ֤ה רַעְיָתִי֙ הִנָּ֣ךְ יָפָ֔ה עֵינַ֣יִךְ יוֹנִ֔ים מִבַּ֖עַד לְצַמָּתֵ֑ךְ שַׂעְרֵךְ֙ כְּעֵ֣דֶר הָֽעִזִּ֔ים שֶׁגָּֽלְשׁ֖וּ מֵהַ֥ר גִּלְעָֽד:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:0:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','Behold you are beautiful, my beloved, behold you are beautiful, your eyes are like doves from within your kerchief; your hair is like a flock of goats descending from Mount Gilead.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:0:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','hee-NAHKH yah-FAH rah-yah-TEE hee-NAHKH yah-FAH ey-NAH-yeekh yoh-NEEM mee-BAH-ahd le-tsah-mah-TEHKH sah-REHKH ke-EH-dehr hah-ee-ZEEM sheh-gah-le-SHOO meh-HAHR geel-ahd:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:1:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','שִׁנַּ֨יִךְ֙ כְּעֵ֣דֶר הַקְּצוּב֔וֹת שֶֽׁעָל֖וּ מִן־הָֽרַחְצָ֑ה שֶׁכֻּלָּם֙ מַתְאִימ֔וֹת וְשַׁכֻּלָ֖ה אֵ֥ין בָּהֶֽם:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:1:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','Your teeth are like a counted flock which have come up from the washing; all of which are perfect and none are blemished among them.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:1:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','shee-NAH-yeekh ke-EH-dehr hah-ke-tsoo-VOHT sheh-ah-LOO meen hah-rahkh-TSAH sheh-koo-LAHM maht-ee-MOHT ve-shah-koo-LAH EYN bah-hehm:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:2:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','כְּח֤וּט הַשָּׁנִי֙ שִׂפְתוֹתַ֔יִךְ וּמִדְבָּרֵ֖ךְ נָאוֶ֑ה כְּפֶ֤לַח הָֽרִמּוֹן֙ רַקָּתֵ֔ךְ מִבַּ֖עַד לְצַמָּתֵֽךְ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:2:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','Like a scarlet thread are your lips, and your speech is comely; like a slice of pomegranate are your cheeks from within your kerchief.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:2:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','ke-KHOOT hah-shah-NEE seef-toh-TAH-yeekh oo-meed-bah-REHKH nah-VEH ke-FEH-lahkh hah-ree-MOHN rah-kah-TEHKH mee-BAH-ahd le-tsah-mah-tehkh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:3:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','כְּמִגְדַּ֤ל דָּוִיד֙ צַוָּארֵ֔ךְ בָּנ֖וּי לְתַלְפִּיּ֑וֹת אֶ֤לֶף הַמָּגֵן֙ תָּל֣וּי עָלָ֔יו כֹּ֖ל שִׁלְטֵ֥י הַגִּבֹּרִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:3:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','Your neck is like the Tower of David, built as a model of beauty; a thousand shields are hung upon it, all the quivers of the mighty.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:3:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','ke-meeg-DAHL dah-VEED tsah-vah-REHKH bah-NOOY le-tahl-pee-YOHT EH-lehf hah-mah-GEHN tah-LOOY ah-LAHV KOHL sheel-TEY hah-gee-boh-reem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:4:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','שְׁנֵ֥י שָׁדַ֛יִךְ כִּשְׁנֵ֥י עֳפָרִ֖ים תְּאוֹמֵ֣י צְבִיָּ֑ה הָֽרֹעִ֖ים בַּשּֽׁוֹשַׁנִּֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:4:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','Your bosom is like two fawns, twins of a gazelle who pasture among the roses.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:4:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','she-NEY shah-DAH-yeekh keesh-NEY oh-fah-REEM te-oh-MEY tse-vee-YAH hah-roh-EEM bah-shoh-shah-neem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:5:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','עַ֤ד שֶׁיָּפ֨וּחַ֙ הַיּ֔וֹם וְנָ֖סוּ הַצְּלָלִ֑ים אֵ֤לֶךְ לִי֙ אֶל־הַ֣ר הַמּ֔וֹר וְאֶל־גִּבְעַ֖ת הַלְּבוֹנָֽה:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:5:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','Until the sun spreads and the shadows flee; I will go to Mount Moriah and to the hill of frankincense.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:5:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','AHD sheh-yah-FOO-ahkh hah-YOHM ve-NAH-soo hah-tse-lah-LEEM EH-lehkh LEE ehl HAHR hah-MOHR ve-ehl geev-AHT hah-le-voh-nah:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:6:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','כֻּלָּ֤ךְ יָפָה֙ רַעְיָתִ֔י וּמ֖וּם אֵ֥ין בָּֽךְ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:6:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','You are completely beautiful, my beloved, and are without blemish.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:6:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','koo-LAHKH yah-FAH rah-yah-TEE oo-MOOM EYN bahkh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:7:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','אִתִּ֤י מִלְּבָנוֹן֙ כַּלָּ֔ה אִתִּ֖י מִלְּבָנ֣וֹן תָּב֑וֹאִי תָּשׁ֣וּרִי | מֵרֹ֣אשׁ אֲמָנָ֗ה מֵרֹ֤אשׁ שְׂנִיר֙ וְחֶרְמ֔וֹן מִמְּעֹנ֣וֹת אֲרָי֔וֹת מֵהַֽרְרֵ֖י נְמֵרִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:7:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','With me [will you come] from Lebanon O bride, with me from Lebanon will you come; you will look from the peak of Amana, from the peaks of Senir of Hermon, from the lions'' dens, from the mountains of leopards.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:7:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','ee-TEE mee-le-vah-NOHN kah-LAH ee-TEE mee-le-vah-NOHN tah-VOH-ee tah-SHOO-ree | meh-ROHSH ah-mah-NAH meh-ROHSH se-NEER ve-khehr-MOHN mee-me-oh-NOHT ah-rah-YOHT meh-hah-re-REY ne-meh-reem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:8:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','לִבַּבְתִּ֖נִי אֲחֹתִ֣י כַלָּ֑ה לִבַּבְתִּ֨נִי֙ בְּאַחַ֣תּ מֵֽעֵינַ֔יִךְ בְּאַחַ֥ד עֲנָ֖ק מִצַּוְּרֹנָֽיִךְ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:8:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','You captured my heart, my sister, O bride; you captured my heart with but one of your eyes, with one necklace of your necklaces.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:8:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','lee-bahv-TEE-nee ah-khoh-TEE khah-LAH lee-bahv-TEE-nee be-ah-KHAHT meh-ey-NAH-yeekh be-ah-KHAHD ah-NAHK mee-tsah-ve-roh-nah-yeekh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:9:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','מַה־יָּפ֥וּ דֹדַ֖יִךְ אֲחֹתִ֣י כַלָּ֑ה מַה־טֹּ֤בוּ דֹדַ֙יִךְ֙ מִיַּ֔יִן וְרֵ֥יחַ שְׁמָנַ֖יִךְ מִכָּל־בְּשָׂמִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:9:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','How beautiful is your love my sister, O bride; how superior is your love to wine, and the fragrance of your oils to all perfumes.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:9:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','mahh yah-FOO doh-DAH-yeekh ah-khoh-TEE khah-LAH mahh TOH-voo doh-DAH-yeekh mee-YAH-yeen ve-REY-ahkh she-mah-NAH-yeekh mee-kohl be-sah-meem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:10:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','נֹ֛פֶת תִּטֹּ֥פְנָה שִׂפְתוֹתַ֖יִךְ כַּלָּ֑ה דְּבַ֤שׁ וְחָלָב֙ תַּ֣חַת לְשׁוֹנֵ֔ךְ וְרֵ֥יחַ שַׂלְמֹתַ֖יִךְ כְּרֵ֥יחַ לְבָנֽוֹן:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:10:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','Your lips drip flowing honey, O bride; honey and milk are under your tongue, and the fragrance of your garments is like the fragrance of Lebanon.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:10:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','NOH-feht tee-TOH-fe-nah seef-toh-TAH-yeekh kah-LAH de-VAHSH ve-khah-LAHV TAH-khaht le-shoh-NEHKH ve-REY-ahkh sahl-moh-TAH-yeekh ke-REY-ahkh le-vah-nohn:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:11:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','גַּ֥ן | נָע֖וּל אֲחֹתִ֣י כַלָּ֑ה גַּ֥ל נָע֖וּל מַעְיָ֥ן חָתֽוּם:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:11:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','A locked garden is my sister, O bride; a locked up spring, a sealed fountain.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:11:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','GAHN | nah-OOL ah-khoh-TEE khah-LAH GAHL nah-OOL mah-YAHN khah-toom:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:12:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','שְׁלָחַ֨יִךְ֙ פַּרְדֵּ֣ס רִמּוֹנִ֔ים עִ֖ם פְּרִ֣י מְגָדִ֑ים כְּפָרִ֖ים עִם־נְרָדִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:12:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','Your arid fields are a pomegranate orchard with luscious fruits; henna with spikenard.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:12:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','she-lah-KHAH-yeekh pahr-DEHS ree-moh-NEEM EEM pe-REE me-gah-DEEM ke-fah-REEM eem ne-rah-deem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:13:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','נֵ֣רְדְּ | וְכַרְכֹּ֗ם קָנֶה֙ וְקִנָּמ֔וֹן עִ֖ם כָּל־עֲצֵ֣י לְבוֹנָ֑ה ֚מֹר וַֽאֲהָל֔וֹת עִ֖ם כָּל־רָאשֵׁ֥י בְשָׂמִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:13:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','Spikenard and saffron, calamus and cinnamon, with all the trees of frankincense; myrrh and aloes with all the major spices.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:13:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','NEHRD | ve-khahr-KOHM kah-NEH ve-kee-nah-MOHN EEM kohl ah-TSEY le-voh-NAH -mohr vah-ah-hah-LOHT EEM kohl rah-SHEY ve-sah-meem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:14:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','מַעְיַ֣ן גַּנִּ֔ים בְּאֵ֖ר מַ֣יִם חַיִּ֑ים וְֽנֹזְלִ֖ים מִן־לְבָנֽוֹן:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:14:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','You are a garden spring, a well of living waters; and flowing streams from Lebanon.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:14:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','mah-YAHN gah-NEEM be-EHR MAH-yeem khah-YEEM ve-noh-ze-LEEM meen le-vah-nohn:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:15:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','he','ע֤וּרִי צָפוֹן֙ וּב֣וֹאִי תֵימָ֔ן הָפִ֥יחִי גַנִּ֖י יִזְּל֣וּ בְשָׂמָ֑יו יָבֹ֤א דוֹדִי֙ לְגַנּ֔וֹ וְיֹאכַ֖ל פְּרִ֥י מְגָדָֽיו:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:15:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','en','Awake, wind from the north and come, wind from the south, blow upon my garden so that its fragrance may flow; let my beloved come to his garden, and eat its luscious fruit.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4:15:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-4','transliteration','OO-ree tsah-FOHN oo-VOH-ee tey-MAHN hah-FEE-khee gah-NEE yee-ze-LOO ve-sah-MAHV yah-VOH doh-DEE le-gah-NOH ve-yoh-KHAHL pe-REE me-gah-dahv:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.4'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:0:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','בָּ֣אתִי לְגַנִּי֘ אֲחֹתִ֣י כַלָּה֒ אָרִ֤יתִי מוֹרִי֙ עִם־בְּשָׂמִ֔י אָכַ֤לְתִּי יַעְרִי֙ עִם־דִּבְשִׁ֔י שָׁתִ֥יתִי יֵינִ֖י עִם־חֲלָבִ֑י אִכְל֣וּ רֵעִ֔ים שְׁת֥וּ וְשִׁכְר֖וּ דּוֹדִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:0:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','I have come to my garden, my sister, O bride, I have gathered my myrrh with my spice, I have eaten my sugar cane with my honey, I have drunk my wine with my milk; eat [my] friends, drink and become intoxicated, [my] beloved ones.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:0:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','BAH-tee le-gah-NEE ah-khoh-TEE khah-LAH ah-REE-tee moh-REE eem be-sah-MEE ah-KHAHL-tee yah-REE eem deev-SHEE shah-TEE-tee yey-NEE eem khah-lah-VEE eekh-LOO reh-EEM she-TOO ve-sheekh-ROO doh-deem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:1:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','אֲנִ֥י יְשֵׁנָ֖ה וְלִבִּ֣י עֵ֑ר ק֣וֹל | דּוֹדִ֣י דוֹפֵ֗ק פִּתְחִי־לִ֞י אֲחֹתִ֤י רַעְיָתִי֙ יֽוֹנָתִ֣י תַמָּתִ֔י שֶׁרֹֹּאשִׁי֙ נִמְלָא־טָ֔ל קְוֻצּוֹתַ֖י רְסִ֥יסֵי לָֽיְלָה:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:1:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','I slept but my heart was awake; a sound! my beloved knocks, open for me, my sister, my love, my dove, my perfection, for my head is drenched [as though] with dew, my sidelocks drip with the rains of night.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:1:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','ah-NEE ye-sheh-NAH ve-lee-BEE EHR KOHL | doh-DEE doh-FEHK peet-khee LEE ah-khoh-TEE rah-yah-TEE yoh-nah-TEE tah-mah-TEE sheh-rohoh-SHEE neem-lah TAHL ke-voo-tsoh-TAHY re-SEE-sey lah-ye-lah:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:2:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','פָּשַׁ֨טְתִּי֙ אֶת־כֻּתָּנְתִּ֔י אֵיכָ֖כָה אֶלְבָּשֶׁ֑נָּה רָחַ֥צְתִּי אֶת־רַגְלַ֖י אֵיכָ֥כָה אֲטַנְּפֵֽם:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:2:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','I have removed my robe, how can I put it on? I have washed my feet, how can I soil them?','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:2:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','pah-SHAHT-tee eht koo-tah-ne-TEE ey-KHAH-khah ehl-bah-SHEH-nah rah-KHAHTS-tee eht rahg-LAHY ey-KHAH-khah ah-tah-ne-fehm:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:3:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','דּוֹדִ֗י שָׁלַ֤ח יָדוֹ מִן־הַח֔וֹר וּמֵעַ֖י הָמ֥וּ עָלָֽיו:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:3:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','My beloved sent forth his hand from the portal, and my innards longed for him.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:3:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','doh-DEE shah-LAHKH yah-doh meen hah-KHOHR oo-meh-AHY hah-MOO ah-lahv:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:4:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','קַ֥מְתִּי אֲנִ֖י לִפְתֹּ֣חַ לְדוֹדִ֑י וְיָדַ֣י נָֽטְפוּ־מ֗וֹר וְאֶצְבְּעֹתַי֙ מ֣וֹר עֹבֵ֔ר עַ֖ל כַּפּ֥וֹת הַמַּנְעֽוּל:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:4:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','I arose to open for my beloved; and my hands dripped myrrh, and my fingers flowed with myrrh from the handles of the lock.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:4:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','KAHM-tee ah-NEE leef-TOH-ahkh le-doh-DEE ve-yah-DAHY nah-te-foo MOHR ve-ehts-be-oh-TAHY MOHR oh-VEHR AHL kah-POHT hah-mahn-ool:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:5:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','פָּתַ֤חְתִּי אֲנִי֙ לְדוֹדִ֔י וְדוֹדִ֖י חָמַ֣ק עָבָ֑ר נַפְשִׁי֙ יָֽצְאָ֣ה בְדַבְּר֔וֹ בִּקַּשְׁתִּ֨יהוּ֙ וְלֹ֣א מְצָאתִ֔יהוּ קְרָאתִ֖יו וְלֹ֥א עָנָֽנִי:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:5:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','I opened for my beloved, but my beloved had vanished and gone; my soul departed as he spoke, I sought him but could not find him, I called him but he would not answer.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:5:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','pah-TAHKH-tee ah-NEE le-doh-DEE ve-doh-DEE khah-MAHK ah-VAHR nahf-SHEE yah-tse-AH ve-dah-be-ROH bee-kahsh-TEE-hoo ve-LOH me-tsah-TEE-hoo ke-rah-TEEV ve-LOH ah-nah-nee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:6:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','מְצָאֻ֧נִי הַשֹּֽׁמְרִ֛ים הַסֹּֽבְבִ֥ים בָּעִ֖יר הִכּ֣וּנִי פְצָע֑וּנִי נָֽשְׂא֤וּ אֶת־רְדִידִי֙ מֵֽעָלַ֔י שֹֽׁמְרֵ֖י הַֽחֹמֽוֹת:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:6:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','The watchmen found me, those who go about the city, they struck me, they wounded me; they stripped my ornament from me, [even] the guards of the wall.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:6:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','me-tsah-OO-nee hah-shoh-me-REEM hah-soh-ve-VEEM bah-EER hee-KOO-nee fe-tsah-OO-nee nah-se-OO eht re-dee-DEE meh-ah-LAHY shoh-me-REY hah-khoh-moht:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:7:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','הִשְׁבַּ֥עְתִּי אֶתְכֶ֖ם בְּנ֣וֹת יְרֽוּשָׁלָ֑םִ אִֽם־תִּמְצְאוּ֙ אֶת־דּוֹדִ֔י מַה־תַּגִּ֣ידוּ ל֔וֹ שֶֽׁחוֹלַ֥ת אַֽהֲבָ֖ה אָֽנִי:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:7:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','I bind you under oath, daughters of Jerusalem; when you find my beloved, what will you tell him? that I am lovesick [for him.]','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:7:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','heesh-BAH-tee eht-KHEHM be-NOHT ye-roo-shah-LAH-mee eem teem-tse-OO eht doh-DEE mahh tah-GEE-doo LOH sheh-khoh-LAHT ah-hah-VAH ah-nee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:8:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','מַה־דּוֹדֵ֣ךְ מִדּ֔וֹד הַיָּפָ֖ה בַּנָּשִׁ֑ים מַה־דּוֹדֵ֣ךְ מִדּ֔וֹד שֶׁכָּ֖כָה הִשְׁבַּעְתָּֽנוּ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:8:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','With what does your beloved excel another beloved, most beautiful among women? With what does your beloved excel another beloved, that you bind us under oath?','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:8:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','mahh doh-DEHKH mee-DOHD hah-yah-FAH bah-nah-SHEEM mahh doh-DEHKH mee-DOHD sheh-KAH-khah heesh-bah-tah-noo:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:9:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','דּוֹדִ֥י צַח֙ וְאָד֔וֹם דָּג֖וּל מֵֽרְבָבָֽה:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:9:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','My beloved is pure white and ruddy, surrounded by myriads.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:9:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','doh-DEE TSAHKH ve-ah-DOHM dah-GOOL meh-re-vah-vah:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:10:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','רֹאשׁ֖וֹ כֶּ֣תֶם פָּ֑ז קְוֻצּוֹתָיו֙ תַּלְתַּלִּ֔ים שְׁחֹר֖וֹת כָּֽעוֹרֵֽב:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:10:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','His head is [like] finest gold, his locks hang, they are raven-black.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:10:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','roh-SHOH KEH-tehm PAHZ ke-voo-tsoh-TAHV tahl-tah-LEEM she-khoh-ROHT kah-oh-rehv:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:11:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','עֵינָ֕יו כְּיוֹנִ֖ים עַל־אֲפִ֣יקֵי מָ֑יִם רֹֽחֲצוֹת֙ בֶּֽחָלָ֔ב יֽשְׁב֖וֹת עַל־מִלֵּֽאת:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:11:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','His eyes are like doves upon brooks of water; bathed in milk, well set in their fullness.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:11:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','ey-NAHV ke-yoh-NEEM ahl ah-FEE-key MAH-yeem roh-khah-TSOHT beh-khah-LAHV yshe-VOHT ahl mee-leht:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:12:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','לְחָיָו֙ כַּֽעֲרוּגַ֣ת הַבֹּ֔שֶׂם מִגְדְּל֖וֹת מֶרְקָחִ֑ים שִׂפְתוֹתָיו֙ שֽׁוֹשַׁנִּ֔ים נֹֽטְפ֖וֹת מ֥וֹר עֹבֵֽר:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:12:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','His cheeks are like a bed of spice, like towers of perfumes; his lips are like roses, dripping [with] flowing myrrh.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:12:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','le-khah-YAHV kah-ah-roo-GAHT hah-BOH-sehm meeg-de-LOHT mehr-kah-KHEEM seef-toh-TAHV shoh-shah-NEEM noh-te-FOHT MOHR oh-vehr:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:13:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','יָדָיו֙ גְּלִילֵ֣י זָהָ֔ב מְמֻלָּאִ֖ים בַּתַּרְשִׁ֑ישׁ מֵעָיו֙ עֶ֣שֶׁת שֵׁ֔ן מְעֻלֶּ֖פֶת סַפִּירִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:13:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','His hands are like rolls of gold studded with precious gems; his innards sparkle like ivory, overlaid with sapphires.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:13:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','yah-DAHV ge-lee-LEY zah-HAHV me-moo-lah-EEM bah-tahr-SHEESH meh-AHV EH-sheht SHEHN me-oo-LEH-feht sah-pee-reem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:14:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','שׁוֹקָיו֙ עַמּ֣וּדֵי שֵׁ֔שׁ מְיֻסָּדִ֖ים עַל־אַדְנֵי־פָ֑ז מַרְאֵ֨הוּ֙ כַּלְּבָנ֔וֹן בָּח֖וּר כָּֽאֲרָזִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:14:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','His legs are like pillars of marble set in sockets of fine gold; his appearance is like Lebanon chosen like the cedars.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:14:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','shoh-KAHV ah-MOO-dey SHEHSH me-yoo-sah-DEEM ahl ahd-ney FAHZ mahr-EH-hoo kah-le-vah-NOHN bah-KHOOR kah-ah-rah-zeem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:15:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','he','חִכּוֹ מַֽמְתַקִּ֔ים וְכֻלּ֖וֹ מַֽחֲמַדִּ֑ים זֶ֤ה דוֹדִי֙ וְזֶ֣ה רֵעִ֔י בְּנ֖וֹת יְרֽוּשָׁלָֽםִ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:15:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','en','[The words of] his palate are sweet, and he is all delight; this is my beloved, and this is my friend, O daughters of Jerusalem.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5:15:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-5','transliteration','khee-koh mah-me-tah-KEEM ve-khoo-LOH mah-khah-mah-DEEM ZEH doh-DEE ve-ZEH reh-EE be-NOHT ye-roo-shah-lah-mee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.5'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:0:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','he','֚אָנָה הָלַ֣ךְ דּוֹדֵ֔ךְ הַיָּפָ֖ה בַּנָּשִׁ֑ים ֚אָנָה פָּנָ֣ה דוֹדֵ֔ךְ וּנְבַקְשֶׁ֖נּוּ עִמָּֽךְ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:0:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','en','Where has your beloved gone O fairest among women? Where has your beloved turned that we may seek him with you?','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:0:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','transliteration','-ah-nah hah-LAHKH doh-DEHKH hah-yah-FAH bah-nah-SHEEM -ah-nah pah-NAH doh-DEHKH oo-ne-vahk-SHEH-noo ee-mahkh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:1:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','he','דּוֹדִי֙ יָרַ֣ד לְגַנּ֔וֹ לַֽעֲרֻג֖וֹת הַבֹּ֑שֶׂם לִרְעוֹת֙ בַּגַּנִּ֔ים וְלִלְקֹ֖ט שֽׁוֹשַׁנִּֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:1:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','en','My beloved has gone down to his garden, to the beds of spices; to graze in the gardens and to gather roses.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:1:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','transliteration','doh-DEE yah-RAHD le-gah-NOH lah-ah-roo-GOHT hah-BOH-sehm leer-OHT bah-gah-NEEM ve-leel-KOHT shoh-shah-neem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:2:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','he','אֲנִ֤י לְדוֹדִי֙ וְדוֹדִ֣י לִ֔י הָֽרוֹעֶ֖ה בַּשּֽׁוֹשַׁנִּֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:2:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','en','I am my beloved''s and my beloved is mine, who grazes among the roses.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:2:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','transliteration','ah-NEE le-doh-DEE ve-doh-DEE LEE hah-roh-EH bah-shoh-shah-neem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:3:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','he','יָפָ֨ה אַ֤תְּ רַעְיָתִי֙ כְּתִרְצָ֔ה נָאוָ֖ה כִּירֽוּשָׁלִָ֑ם אֲיֻמָּ֖ה כַּנִּדְגָּלֽוֹת:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:3:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','en','You are beautiful, my beloved, as Tirzah, comely as Jerusalem, awesome as the hosts [of angels].','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:3:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','transliteration','yah-FAH AHT rah-yah-TEE ke-teer-TSAH nah-VAH kee-roo-shah-LAH-eem ah-yoo-MAH kah-need-gah-loht:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:4:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','he','הָסֵ֤בִּי עֵינַ֨יִךְ֙ מִנֶּגְדִּ֔י שֶׁ֥הֵ֖ם הִרְהִיבֻ֑נִי שַׂעְרֵךְ֙ כְּעֵ֣דֶר הָֽעִזִּ֔ים שֶׁגָּֽלְשׁ֖וּ מִן־הַגִּלְעָֽד:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:4:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','en','Turn your eyes away from me, for they made me haughty; your hair is like a flock of goats descending from Mount Gilead.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:4:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','transliteration','hah-SEH-bee ey-NAH-yeekh mee-nehg-DEE SHEH-HEHM heer-hee-VOO-nee sah-REHKH ke-EH-dehr hah-ee-ZEEM sheh-gah-le-SHOO meen hah-geel-ahd:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:5:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','he','שִׁנַּ֨יִךְ֙ כְּעֵ֣דֶר הָֽרְחֵלִ֔ים שֶֽׁעָל֖וּ מִן־הָֽרַחְצָ֑ה שֶׁכֻּלָּם֙ מַתְאִימ֔וֹת וְשַׁכֻּלָ֖ה אֵ֥ין בָּהֶֽם:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:5:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','en','Your teeth are like a counted flock which have come up from the washing; all of which are perfect and none are blemished among them.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:5:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','transliteration','shee-NAH-yeekh ke-EH-dehr hah-re-kheh-LEEM sheh-ah-LOO meen hah-rahkh-TSAH sheh-koo-LAHM maht-ee-MOHT ve-shah-koo-LAH EYN bah-hehm:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:6:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','he','כְּפֶ֤לַח הָֽרִמּוֹן֙ רַקָּתֵ֔ךְ מִבַּ֖עַד לְצַמָּתֵֽךְ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:6:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','en','Like a slice of pomegranate are your cheeks from within your kerchief.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:6:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','transliteration','ke-FEH-lahkh hah-ree-MOHN rah-kah-TEHKH mee-BAH-ahd le-tsah-mah-tehkh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:7:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','he','שִׁשִּׁ֥ים הֵ֨מָּה֙ מְלָכ֔וֹת וּשְׁמֹנִ֖ים פִּֽילַגְשִׁ֑ים וַֽעֲלָמ֖וֹת אֵ֥ין מִסְפָּֽר:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:7:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','en','There are sixty queens and eighty concubines, and young maidens without number.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:7:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','transliteration','shee-SHEEM HEH-mah me-lah-KHOHT oo-she-moh-NEEM pee-lahg-SHEEM vah-ah-lah-MOHT EYN mees-pahr:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:8:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','he','אַחַ֥ת הִיא֙ יֽוֹנָתִ֣י תַמָּתִ֔י אַחַ֥ת הִיא֙ לְאִמָּ֔הּ בָּרָ֥ה הִ֖יא לְיֽוֹלַדְתָּ֑הּ רָא֤וּהָ בָנוֹת֙ וַֽיְאַשְּׁר֔וּהָ מְלָכ֥וֹת וּפִֽילַגְשִׁ֖ים וַֽיְהַֽלְלֽוּהָ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:8:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','en','But she is unique, my dove, my perfect one, she is unique to her mother, she is pure to her who begot her; daughters saw her and acclaimed her, queens and concubines, and they praised her.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:8:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','transliteration','ah-KHAHT HEE yoh-nah-TEE tah-mah-TEE ah-KHAHT HEE le-ee-MAHH bah-RAH HEE le-yoh-lahd-TAHH rah-OO-hah vah-NOHT vah-ye-ah-she-ROO-hah me-lah-KHOHT oo-fee-lahg-SHEEM vah-ye-hah-le-loo-hah:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:9:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','he','מִי־זֹ֥את הַנִּשְׁקָפָ֖ה כְּמוֹ־שָׁ֑חַר יָפָ֣ה כַלְּבָנָ֗ה בָּרָה֙ כַּֽחַמָּ֔ה אֲיֻמָּ֖ה כַּנִּדְגָּלֽוֹת:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:9:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','en','Who is this that gazes down like the [breaking] dawn, beautiful as the moon, bright as the sun, awesome as the hosts [of angels]?','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:9:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','transliteration','mee ZOHT hah-neesh-kah-FAH ke-moh SHAH-khahr yah-FAH khah-le-vah-NAH bah-RAH kah-khah-MAH ah-yoo-MAH kah-need-gah-loht:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:10:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','he','אֶל־גִּנַּ֤ת אֱגוֹז֙ יָרַ֔דְתִּי לִרְא֖וֹת בְּאִבֵּ֣י הַנָּ֑חַל לִרְאוֹת֙ הֲפָֽרְחָ֣ה הַגֶּ֔פֶן הֵנֵ֖צוּ הָֽרִמֹּנִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:10:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','en','I went down to the garden of nuts, to see the moist plants of the valley; to see whether the vine had blossomed, if the pomegranates had sprouted.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:10:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','transliteration','ehl gee-NAHT eh-GOHZ yah-RAHD-tee leer-OHT be-ee-BEY hah-NAH-khahl leer-OHT hah-fah-re-KHAH hah-GEH-fehn heh-NEH-tsoo hah-ree-moh-neem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:11:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','he','לֹ֣א יָדַ֔עְתִּי נַפְשִׁ֣י שָׂמַ֔תְנִי מַרְכְּב֖וֹת עַמִּ֥י נָדִֽיב:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:11:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','en','I did not know, my soul set me like chariots of a noble people.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6:11:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-6','transliteration','LOH yah-DAH-tee nahf-SHEE sah-MAHT-nee mahr-ke-VOHT ah-MEE nah-deev:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.6'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:0:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','he','שׁ֤וּבִי שׁ֨וּבִי֙ הַשּׁ֣וּלַמִּ֔ית שׁ֥וּבִי שׁ֖וּבִי וְנֶֽחֱזֶה־בָּ֑ךְ מַֽה־תֶּֽחֱזוּ֙ בַּשּׁ֣וּלַמִּ֔ית כִּמְחֹלַ֖ת הַֽמַּֽחֲנָֽיִם:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:0:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','en','Turn back, turn back [you] perfect one, turn back, turn back, that we may observe you; what can you see [offer] the perfect one that equals the encirclement of the camps?','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:0:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','transliteration','SHOO-vee SHOO-vee hah-SHOO-lah-MEET SHOO-vee SHOO-vee ve-neh-kheh-zeh BAHKH mahh teh-kheh-ZOO bah-SHOO-lah-MEET keem-khoh-LAHT hah-mah-khah-nah-yeem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:1:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','he','מַה־יָּפ֧וּ פְעָמַ֛יִךְ בַּנְּעָלִ֖ים בַּת־נָדִ֑יב חַמּוּקֵ֣י יְרֵכַ֔יִךְ כְּמ֣וֹ חֲלָאִ֔ים מַֽעֲשֵׂ֖ה יְדֵ֥י אָמָּֽן:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:1:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','en','How fair were your feet in sandals, O daughter of nobles; the roundness of your flanks, are like jewels, the work of a craftsman.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:1:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','transliteration','mahh yah-FOO fe-ah-MAH-yeekh bah-ne-ah-LEEM baht nah-DEEV khah-moo-KEY ye-reh-KHAH-yeekh ke-MOH khah-lah-EEM mah-ah-SEH ye-DEY ah-mahn:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:2:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','he','שָׁרְרֵךְ֙ אַגַּ֣ן הַסַּ֔הַר אַל־יֶחְסַ֖ר הַמָּ֑זֶג בִּטְנֵךְ֙ עֲרֵמַ֣ת חִטִּ֔ים סוּגָ֖ה בַּשּֽׁוֹשַׁנִּֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:2:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','en','Your navel is like a round bowl, which lacks not for mixed wines; your stomach is like a heap of wheat, hedged about with roses.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:2:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','transliteration','shah-re-REHKH ah-GAHN hah-SAH-hahr ahl yehkh-SAHR hah-MAH-zehg beet-NEHKH ah-reh-MAHT khee-TEEM soo-GAH bah-shoh-shah-neem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:3:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','he','שְׁנֵ֥י שָׁדַ֛יִךְ כִּשְׁנֵ֥י עֳפָרִ֖ים תָּֽאֳמֵ֥י צְבִיָּֽה:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:3:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','en','Your two breasts are like two fawns, twins of a gazelle.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:3:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','transliteration','she-NEY shah-DAH-yeekh keesh-NEY oh-fah-REEM toh-oh-MEY tse-vee-yah:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:4:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','he','צַוָּארֵ֖ךְ כְּמִגְדַּ֣ל הַשֵּׁ֑ן עֵינַ֜יִךְ בְּרֵכ֣וֹת בְּחֶשְׁבּ֗וֹן עַל־שַׁ֨עַר֙ בַּת־רַבִּ֔ים אַפֵּךְ֙ כְּמִגְדַּ֣ל הַלְּבָנ֔וֹן צוֹפֶ֖ה פְּנֵ֥י דַמָּֽשֶׂק:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:4:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','en','Your neck is like an ivory tower; your eyes are like pools in Heshbon, at the gate of the populated city, your face is like a tower of Lebanon looking out as far as Damascus.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:4:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','transliteration','tsah-vah-REHKH ke-meeg-DAHL hah-SHEHN ey-NAH-yeekh be-reh-KHOHT be-khehsh-BOHN ahl SHAH-ahr baht rah-BEEM ah-PEHKH ke-meeg-DAHL hah-le-vah-NOHN tsoh-FEH pe-NEY dah-mah-sehk:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:5:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','he','רֹאשֵׁ֤ךְ עָלַ֨יִךְ֙ כַּכַּרְמֶ֔ל וְדַלַּ֥ת רֹאשֵׁ֖ךְ כָּֽאַרְגָּמָ֑ן מֶ֖לֶךְ אָס֥וּר בָּֽרְהָטִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:5:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','en','That which is upon your head is like Mount Carmel, and the braid of your head is like [royal] purple wool; your King is bound in its tresses.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:5:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','transliteration','roh-SHEHKH ah-LAH-yeekh kah-kahr-MEHL ve-dah-LAHT roh-SHEHKH kah-ahr-gah-MAHN MEH-lehkh ah-SOOR bah-re-hah-teem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:6:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','he','מַה־יָּפִית֙ וּמַה־נָּעַ֔מְתְּ אַֽהֲבָ֖ה בַּתַּֽעֲנוּגִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:6:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','en','How beautiful and pleasant are you; a love with delights.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:6:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','transliteration','mahh yah-FEET oo-mahh nah-AHMT ah-hah-VAH bah-tah-ah-noo-geem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:7:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','he','זֹ֤את קֽוֹמָתֵךְ֙ דָּֽמְתָ֣ה לְתָמָ֔ר וְשָׁדַ֖יִךְ לְאַשְׁכֹּלֽוֹת:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:7:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','en','Such is your stature, likened to a [stately] palm tree; and your bosom is like clusters.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:7:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','transliteration','ZOHT koh-mah-TEHKH dah-me-TAH le-tah-MAHR ve-shah-DAH-yeekh le-ahsh-koh-loht:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:8:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','he','אָמַ֨רְתִּי֙ אֶֽעֱלֶ֣ה בְתָמָ֔ר אֹֽחֲזָ֖ה בְּסַנְסִנָּ֑יו וְיִֽהְיוּ־נָ֤א שָׁדַ֙יִךְ֙ כְּאֶשְׁכְּל֣וֹת הַגֶּ֔פֶן וְרֵ֥יחַ אַפֵּ֖ךְ כַּתַּפּוּחִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:8:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','en','I said, I will ascend the palm tree, I will grasp its branches; and now, let your bosom remain like clusters of the vine, and the fragrance of your face like apples.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:8:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','transliteration','ah-MAHR-tee eh-eh-LEH ve-tah-MAHR oh-khah-ZAH be-sahn-see-NAHV ve-yee-he-yoo NAH shah-DAH-yeekh ke-ehsh-ke-LOHT hah-GEH-fehn ve-REY-ahkh ah-PEHKH kah-tah-poo-kheem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:9:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','he','וְחִכֵּ֕ךְ כְּיֵ֥ין הַטּ֛וֹב הוֹלֵ֥ךְ לְדוֹדִ֖י לְמֵֽישָׁרִ֑ים דּוֹבֵ֖ב שִׂפְתֵ֥י יְשֵׁנִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:9:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','en','And let your speech be like good wine; it flows for my beloved in sincerity, causing the lips of sleepers to murmur.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:9:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','transliteration','ve-khee-KEHKH ke-YEYN hah-TOHV hoh-LEHKH le-doh-DEE le-mey-shah-REEM doh-VEHV seef-TEY ye-sheh-neem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:10:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','he','אֲנִ֣י לְדוֹדִ֔י וְעָלַ֖י תְּשֽׁוּקָתֽוֹ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:10:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','en','I am my beloved''s and he longs for me.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:10:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','transliteration','ah-NEE le-doh-DEE ve-ah-LAHY te-shoo-kah-toh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:11:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','he','לְכָ֤ה דוֹדִי֙ נֵצֵ֣א הַשָדֶ֔ה נָלִ֖ינָה בַּכְּפָרִֽים:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:11:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','en','Come, my beloved, let us go out to the field, let us lodge in the villages.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:11:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','transliteration','le-KHAH doh-DEE neh-TSEH hah-shah-DEH nah-LEE-nah bah-ke-fah-reem:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:12:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','he','נַשְׁכִּ֨ימָה֙ לַכְּרָמִ֔ים נִרְאֶ֞ה אִם־פָּֽרְחָ֤ה הַגֶּ֨פֶן֨ פִּתַּ֣ח הַסְּמָדַ֔ר הֵנֵ֖צוּ הָֽרִמּוֹנִ֑ים שָׁ֛ם אֶתֵּ֥ן אֶת־דֹּדַ֖י לָֽךְ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:12:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','en','Let us rise early for the vineyards, let us see if the vine has blossomed, if the tender grapes have appeared, if the pomegranates are in bloom; there I will give my love to you.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:12:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','transliteration','nahsh-KEE-mah lah-ke-rah-MEEM neer-EH eem pah-re-KHAH hah-GEH-FEHN pee-TAHKH hah-se-mah-DAHR heh-NEH-tsoo hah-ree-moh-NEEM SHAHM eh-TEHN eht doh-DAHY lahkh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:13:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','he','הַדּֽוּדָאִ֣ים נָֽתְנוּ־רֵ֗יחַ וְעַל־פְּתָחֵ֨ינוּ֙ כָּל־מְגָדִ֔ים חֲדָשִׁ֖ים גַּם־יְשָׁנִ֑ים דּוֹדִ֖י צָפַ֥נְתִּי לָֽךְ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:13:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','en','The baskets emit fragrance, and at our door are all luscious fruits, both new and old; my beloved, I have kept them for you.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7:13:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-7','transliteration','hah-doo-dah-EEM nah-te-noo REY-ahkh ve-ahl pe-tah-KHEY-noo kohl me-gah-DEEM khah-dah-SHEEM gahm ye-shah-NEEM doh-DEE tsah-FAHN-tee lahkh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.7'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:0:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','he','מִ֤י יִתֶּנְךָ֙ כְּאָ֣ח לִ֔י יוֹנֵ֖ק שְׁדֵ֣י אִמִּ֑י אֶֽמְצָֽאֲךָ֤ בַחוּץ֙ אֶשָּׁ֣קְךָ֔ גַּ֖ם לֹֽא־יָבֻ֥זוּ לִֽי:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:0:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','en','If only you were a brother to me, who had nursed at my mother''s bosom; when I would find you outside I would kiss you, and no one would scorn me.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:0:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','transliteration','MEE yee-tehn-KHAH ke-AHKH LEE yoh-NEHK she-DEY ee-MEE eh-me-tsah-ah-KHAH vah-KHOOTS eh-SHAH-ke-KHAH GAHM loh yah-VOO-zoo lee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:1:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','he','אֶנְהָֽגְךָ֗ אֲבִֽיאֲךָ֛ אֶל־בֵּ֥ית אִמִּ֖י תְּלַמְּדֵ֑נִי אַשְׁקְךָ֙ מִיַּ֣יִן הָרֶ֔קַח מֵֽעֲסִ֖יס רִמֹּנִֽי:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:1:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','en','I would lead you, I would bring you to my mother''s house that you should teach me; I would give you spiced wine to drink, of the nectar of my pomegranate.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:1:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','transliteration','ehn-hah-ge-KHAH ah-vee-ah-KHAH ehl BEYT ee-MEE te-lah-me-DEH-nee ahsh-ke-KHAH mee-YAH-yeen hah-REH-kahkh meh-ah-SEES ree-moh-nee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:2:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','he','שְׂמֹאלוֹ תַּ֣חַת רֹאשִׁ֔י וִֽימִינ֖וֹ תְּחַבְּקֵֽנִי:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:2:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','en','His left hand is under my head and his right hand embraces me.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:2:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','transliteration','se-moh-loh TAH-khaht roh-SHEE vee-mee-NOH te-khah-be-keh-nee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:3:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','he','הִשְׁבַּ֥עְתִּי אֶתְכֶ֖ם בְּנ֣וֹת יְרֽוּשָׁלִָ֑ם מַה־תָּעִ֧ירוּ | וּֽמַה־תְּעֹֽרְר֛וּ אֶת־הָאַֽהֲבָ֖ה עַ֥ד־שֶׁתֶּחְפָּֽץ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:3:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','en','I bind you under oath daughters of Jerusalem why should you cause hatred or disturb [this] love while it still pleases?','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:3:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','transliteration','heesh-BAH-tee eht-KHEHM be-NOHT ye-roo-shah-LAH-eem mahh tah-EE-roo | oo-mahh te-oh-re-ROO eht hah-ah-hah-VAH AHD sheh-tehkh-PAHTS:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:4:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','he','מִ֣י זֹ֗את עֹלָה֙ מִן־הַמִּדְבָּ֔ר מִתְרַפֶּ֖קֶת עַל־דּוֹדָ֑הּ תַּ֤חַת הַתַּפּ֨וּחַ֙ עֽוֹרַרְתִּ֔יךָ ֚שָׁמָּה חִבְּלָֽתְךָ֣ אִמֶּ֔ךָ שָׁ֖מָּה חִבְּלָ֥ה יְלָדַֽתְךָ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:4:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','en','Who is she that rises from the desert, clinging to her beloved? beneath the apple tree I aroused you, there your mother had birth pains there she who bore you suffered.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:4:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','transliteration','MEE ZOHT oh-LAH meen hah-meed-BAHR meet-rah-PEH-keht ahl doh-DAHH TAH-khaht hah-tah-POO-ahkh oh-rahr-TEE-khah -shah-mah khee-be-lah-te-KHAH ee-MEH-khah SHAH-mah khee-be-LAH ye-lah-dah-te-khah:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:5:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','he','שִׂימֵ֨נִי כַֽחוֹתָ֜ם עַל־לִבֶּ֗ךָ כַּֽחוֹתָם֙ עַל־זְרוֹעֶ֔ךָ כִּֽי־עַזָּ֤ה כַמָּ֨וֶת֙ אַֽהֲבָ֔ה קָשָׁ֥ה כִשְׁא֖וֹל קִנְאָ֑ה רְשָׁפֶ֕יהָ רִשְׁפֵּ֕י אֵ֖שׁ שַׁלְהֶֽבֶתְיָֽה:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:5:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','en','Set me as a seal upon your heart as a seal upon your arm, for love is as strong as death, jealousy is as harsh as the grave; its flashes are flashes of fire from the flame of God.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:5:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','transliteration','see-MEH-nee khah-khoh-TAHM ahl lee-BEH-khah kah-khoh-TAHM ahl ze-roh-EH-khah kee ah-ZAH khah-MAH-veht ah-hah-VAH kah-SHAH kheesh-OHL keen-AH re-shah-FEY-hah reesh-PEY EHSH shahl-heh-veht-yah:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:6:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','he','מַ֣יִם רַבִּ֗ים לֹ֤א יֽוּכְלוּ֙ לְכַבּ֣וֹת אֶת־הָאַֽהֲבָ֔ה וּנְהָ֖רוֹת לֹ֣א יִשְׁטְפ֑וּהָ אִם־יִתֵּ֨ן אִ֜ישׁ אֶת־כָּל־ה֤וֹן בֵּיתוֹ בָּאַֽהֲבָ֔ה בּ֖וֹז יָב֥וּזוּ לֽוֹ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:6:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','en','Many waters cannot quench the love, and rivers cannot drown it; if a man would give all the wealth of his house for love they would surely scorn him.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:6:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','transliteration','MAH-yeem rah-BEEM LOH yoo-khe-LOO le-khah-BOHT eht hah-ah-hah-VAH oo-ne-HAH-roht LOH yeesh-te-FOO-hah eem yee-TEHN EESH eht kohl HOHN bey-toh bah-ah-hah-VAH BOHZ yah-VOO-zoo loh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:7:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','he','אָח֥וֹת לָ֨נוּ֙ קְטַנָּ֔ה וְשָׁדַ֖יִם אֵ֣ין לָ֑הּ מַֽה־נַּֽעֲשֶׂה֙ לַֽאֲחוֹתֵ֔נוּ בַּיּ֖וֹם שֶׁיְּדֻבַּר־בָּֽהּ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:7:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','en','We have a little sister but she has no bosom; what shall we do for our sister on the day she is spoken for?','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:7:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','transliteration','ah-KHOHT LAH-noo ke-tah-NAH ve-shah-DAH-yeem EYN LAHH mahh nah-ah-SEH lah-ah-khoh-TEH-noo bah-YOHM sheh-ye-doo-bahr bahh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:8:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','he','אִם־חוֹמָ֣ה הִ֔יא נִבְנֶ֥ה עָלֶ֖יהָ טִ֣ירַת כָּ֑סֶף וְאִם־דֶּ֣לֶת הִ֔יא נָצ֥וּר עָלֶ֖יהָ ל֥וּחַ אָֽרֶז:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:8:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','en','If she be a wall we will build upon her a fortress of silver, if she be a door, we will enclose her with panels of cedar.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:8:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','transliteration','eem khoh-MAH HEE neev-NEH ah-LEY-hah TEE-raht KAH-sehf ve-eem DEH-leht HEE nah-TSOOR ah-LEY-hah LOO-ahkh ah-rehz:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:9:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','he','אֲנִ֣י חוֹמָ֔ה וְשָׁדַ֖י כַּמִּגְדָּל֑וֹת אָ֛ז הָיִ֥יתִי בְעֵינָ֖יו כְּמֽוֹצְאֵ֖ת שָׁלֽוֹם:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:9:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','en','I am a wall and my bosom is like towers; therefore I am in his eyes as one who found peace.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:9:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','transliteration','ah-NEE khoh-MAH ve-shah-DAHY kah-meeg-dah-LOHT AHZ hah-YEE-tee ve-ey-NAHV ke-moh-tse-EHT shah-lohm:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:10:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','he','כֶּ֣רֶם הָיָ֤ה לִשְׁלֹמֹה֙ בְּבַ֣עַל הָמ֔וֹן נָתַ֥ן אֶת־הַכֶּ֖רֶם לַנֹּֽטְרִ֑ים אִ֛ישׁ יָבִ֥א בְּפִרְי֖וֹ אֶ֥לֶף כָּֽסֶף:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:10:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','en','Shlomo had a vineyard in Baal Hamon, he gave over the vineyard to caretakers; each of them brought for its fruit a thousand pieces of silver.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:10:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','transliteration','KEH-rehm hah-YAH leesh-loh-MOHH be-VAH-ahl hah-MOHN nah-TAHN eht hah-KEH-rehm lah-noh-te-REEM EESH yah-VEE be-feer-YOH EH-lehf kah-sehf:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:11:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','he','כַּרְמִ֥י שֶׁלִּ֖י לְפָנָ֑י הָאֶ֤לֶף לְךָ֙ שְׁלֹֹמֹ֔ה וּמָאתַ֖יִם לְנֹֽטְרִ֥ים אֶת־פִּרְיֽוֹ:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:11:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','en','My vineyard is before me; the thousand are yours, Shlomo, and two hundred are for those who guard its fruit.','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:11:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','transliteration','kahr-MEE sheh-LEE le-fah-NAHY hah-EH-lehf le-KHAH she-lohoh-MOHH oo-mah-TAH-yeem le-noh-te-REEM eht peer-yoh:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:12:he','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','he','הַיּוֹשֶׁ֣בֶת בַּגַּנִּ֗ים חֲבֵרִ֛ים מַקְשִׁיבִ֥ים לְקוֹלֵ֖ךְ הַשְׁמִיעִֽנִי:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:12:en','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','en','You who sit in the gardens, companions listen to your voice, let me hear [your voice].','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
('sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8:12:transliteration','sefaria-shabbat-siddur-sefard-linear-song-of-songs-8','transliteration','hah-yoh-SHEH-veht bah-gah-NEEM khah-veh-REEM mahk-shee-VEEM le-koh-LEHKH hahsh-mee-ee-nee:','Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Song of Songs.8'),
