('sefaria-weekday-siddur-sefard-linear-the-morning-prayers-blessings-of-the-torah:59:he','sefaria-weekday-siddur-sefard-linear-the-morning-prayers-blessings-of-the-torah','he','וְתַלְמוּד תּוֹרָה כְּנֶֽגֶד כֻּלָּם:','Weekday Siddur Sefard Linear, The Morning Prayers, Blessings of the Torah'),
('sefaria-weekday-siddur-sefard-linear-the-morning-prayers-blessings-of-the-torah:59:en','sefaria-weekday-siddur-sefard-linear-the-morning-prayers-blessings-of-the-torah','en','and the study of Torah is equal to them all.','Weekday Siddur Sefard Linear, The Morning Prayers, Blessings of the Torah'),
