('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-2:12:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-2','he','כְּדַלִּים וּכְרָשִׁים','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, First Day.2'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-2:12:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-2','en','but like the poor and needy','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, First Day.2'),
