('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-2:14:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-2','en','At Your door, do we knock,','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, First Day.2'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-2:14:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-2','transliteration','de-lah-tey-khah dah-fahk-noo','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, First Day.2'),
